 Version note: this revision no longer inserts the theme sidebar automatically on every page. Existing floated infoboxes inside page content are styled to match the cork-and-stone sidebar. The sidebar.php template remains available for deliberate future use.
+
+
+Version 1.1.9
+-------------
+Adds an editable Deck of Chars homepage card and a primary navigation link.
+The homepage uses two columns on desktop and one on narrower screens.
+Existing primary menu links and saved homepage descriptions are preserved.
+
+Full Parchment Width page template
+---------------------------------
+Edit a normal page and choose Full Parchment Width in its Page settings >
+Template field, then update the page. This template uses the complete usable
+width inside the existing parchment. The frame and its padding remain the
+same. Page title, breadcrumbs and content remain available; the theme inserts
+no sidebar. Wide/full block alignments stay inside the parchment.
+The existing Full Width Page template for wider embedded tools is unchanged.
+
+Updating the theme
+------------------
+Upload the theme ZIP through Appearance > Themes > Add New > Upload Theme,
+then choose Replace current with uploaded. This is an update of the existing
+Bree Legends theme. Deck character data is managed by its separate plugin.
